<title>USA: U.S. DAP prices underpinned by export business.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP prices underpinned by export business.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices for U.S. ammonia and diammonium phosphate (DAP) were unchanged Friday in quiet dealings, dealers said.</p>
<p>DAP prices were underpinned by large purchases by India and Turkey this week, cash sources said.</p>
<p>Application of fertilizer in the Midwest remained slow because of very wet conditions there, dealers said.</p>
<p>			  Dlrs/short ton	 Chg from Wednesday</p>
